{'symbol': 'PCG', 'date': '2022-11-17 17:44:00', 'title': "IN SERVICE TO HOMETOWNS AND NONPROFIT ORGANIZATIONS, PG&E COWORKERS CELEBRATE HOLIDAY SEASON WITH ‘WEEKS OF GIVING' CAMPAIGN", 'text': 'OAKLAND, CALIF.--( BUSINESS WIRE )--PACIFIC GAS AND ELECTRIC COMPANY (PG&E) IS KICKING OFF THE 2022 SEASON OF GIVING BY PARTNERING WITH NONPROFIT GROUPS TO GIVE BACK TO THE CUSTOMERS AND HOMETOWNS IT IS PRIVILEGED TO SERVE IN NORTHERN AND CENTRAL CALIFORNIA.'}